[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_9999","text":"AD"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0010","text":"──────……\n诶，已经回去了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0020","text":"……？　是的。现在坐出租车……\n七草小姐说她回去的方向不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0030","text":"『日花\n　已经到家了吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0040","text":"嗒……嗒嗒……\n……──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0050","text":"————果然，让人声重合比较好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0060","text":"日花……家里、练功房、河边都不在──\n────问问美琴吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0070","text":"────美琴也不接电话啊……\n………………难道说──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0080","text":"──────向上……向上…………\n１、２…………──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0090","text":"────────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0100","text":"……\n门开着……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0110","text":"………………美琴小姐"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0120","text":"……怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0130","text":"那、那个，突然就跑来了…………非常抱歉…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0140","text":"……没注意到\n我在通风，进来吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0150","text":"……练、练习…………\n不练不行…………可是在这个时间点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0160","text":"……？\n嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0170","text":"我、我明白的……对不起，打扰美琴你练习了\n而且我也没能练到能配合上的程度，来了也，那个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0180","text":"…………咦，门开着啊\n在里面的是美琴和日花……吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0190","text":"……你是来找我说，你做不到吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_04_0200","text":"是、是的………………\n──────我是来……说做不到的……"}]
